---
import Cmd from "./Cmd.astro";

const repo = "https://github.com/Nokky21/DocKeeper";
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <a class="pill" href={`${repo}/releases/latest`} data-reveal><b>v0.2.0</b> Open source · MIT · Read the release <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <h1 data-reveal style="--d:60ms">Documentation that doesn't rot.</h1>
      <p class="lead" data-reveal style="--d:120ms">DocKeeper anchors every claim in your docs to the code behind it. When that code changes, <em>your CI knows which sentence just became false.</em></p>
      <div class="ctas" data-reveal style="--d:180ms">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#demo">Try it live</a>
        <a class="textlink" href="#install">Install the skill <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="oneliner" data-reveal style="--d:240ms">
        <Cmd cmd="git clone https://github.com/Nokky21/DocKeeper.git ~/.claude/skills/dockeeper" />
      </div>
      <p class="compat" data-reveal style="--d:300ms">An Agent Skill for <span>Claude Code</span><span>Codex</span><span>Gemini CLI</span><span>Cursor</span><span>GitHub Copilot</span> and a zero-dependency CLI for CI.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stack" data-reveal style="--d:200ms" role="img" aria-label="A documentation page whose two claims are anchored to code, and the output of dockeeper check: one claim changed, one moved, exit code 1">
      <div class="card doccard">
        <div class="file"><i></i>docs/payments.md</div>
        <div class="doc-title">Payments</div>
        <div class="claim" data-v="CHANGED">
          <p>Every payment is validated before it is charged.</p>
          <span class="anchor"><span>&#91;&#91;src/payments.py#validate_payment&#93;&#93;</span><b class="v v-CHANGED">CHANGED</b></span>
        </div>
        <div class="claim" data-v="MOVED">
          <p>A successful charge returns its status.</p>
          <span class="anchor"><span>&#91;&#91;src/payments.py:12&#93;&#93;</span><b class="v v-MOVED">MOVED</b></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card termcard">
        <div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
<pre><span class="cmdl">$ dockeeper check</span>
<span class="v-CHANGED">CHANGED</span>  docs/payments.md:3 → src/payments.py#validate_payment
<span class="v-MOVED">MOVED</span>    docs/payments.md:4 → src/payments.py:12
<span class="cmdl">$ echo $?</span>
1</pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
